# Routes (AutoRoute)

Use AutoRoute only. Do not add `go_router` or `Navigator.push(MaterialPageRoute(...))`.

## Add a screen

1. Annotate the page widget: `@RoutePage()`
2. Page file is `part of '<page>_imports.dart'`
3. Register in `lib/core/routes/router.dart` or the feature `presentation/manager/routes/routes.dart` list that `AppRouter` spreads
4. Run `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`

```dart
@AutoRouterConfig()
class AppRouter extends $AppRouter {
  @override
  final List<AutoRoute> routes = [
    AdaptiveRoute(page: Splash.page, initial: true),
    AdaptiveRoute(page: Login.page),
    AutoRoute(page: Home.page),
    ...baseRoute,
  ];
}
```

```dart
// Navigate
AutoRouter.of(context).push(HomeRoute());
AutoRouter.of(context).replace(LoginRoute());
AutoRouter.of(context).pop();
```

Pass typed args through the generated `*Route` constructor — not `ModalRoute.of` extras.
